# Regression for HDR and fullscreen switched during play (the pause menu's
# DISPLAY rows set the same options, from the game's thread as the dev pad does),
# with no host overlay, then with the F4 settings overlay open, then with the
# console overlay open: both overlays read options from the UI thread every
# frame, which deadlocked the fullscreen switch before
# rexglue-fullscreen-setting-ui-thread.patch. Pass: the run ends by itself and
# every mark's swap count is higher than the one before.
wait 8s
mark title
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
set hdr on
mark plain
wait 3s
set hdr off
mark plain_hdr_off
wait 3s
set hdr on
mark plain_hdr_on
wait 3s
set fullscreen true
mark plain_fullscreen
wait 3s
set fullscreen false
mark plain_windowed
wait 3s
key F4
mark settings
wait 3s
set hdr off
mark settings_hdr_off
wait 3s
set hdr on
mark settings_hdr_on
wait 3s
set fullscreen true
mark settings_fullscreen
wait 3s
set fullscreen false
mark settings_windowed
wait 3s
key F4
key Backtick
mark console
wait 3s
set fullscreen true
mark console_fullscreen
wait 3s
set fullscreen false
mark console_windowed
wait 3s
key Backtick
mark closed
wait 3s
mark end
